ate>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to P/U torque tool BHA (run#16)</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-20T19:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-20T19:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U and M/U torque  tool to 3m.  Removed FOSV from swedge</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-20T19:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-20T20:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U 1x stand of 5,5in HWDP and M/U to X-over, RIH w/ 5,5in HWDP from 3m to 117m. Torqued all connections to 67500 kNm</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-20T20:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-20T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>M/U TDS to 5,5in  DP, RIH to 140m, started pumping with 1450 l/m, rotated w/ 10rpm. Jetted tie-back adapter area</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-20T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-20T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml